  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "DESIGN:OS Studio",
  "description": "Local stdio MCP server for DESIGN:OS Studio, a FREE source-available (PolyForm Shield 1.0.0) interface design tool. Agents inspect and edit a .fig or .designos document over 39 tools, then save or export inside a configured workspace. Standalone edits stay in memory until save; a connected Studio session also persists live changes in its session folder. The server does not listen on a network port. Off until you turn it on.",
